s valid for 7 days. After expiration, you will need to generate a new one.</span></p><p class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg class=\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-gray-500\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M10.5 1.5H8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 3.75v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 20.25V3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H13.5m-3 0V3h3V1.5m-3 0h3m-3 18.75h3\"></path></svg><span>Each configuration can only be used on one device at a time. Please generate a separate configuration for each device.</span></p></div><label class=\"mt-4 flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border-2 p-3 transition-colors border-gray-300 bg-white hover:border-gray-400\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"h-5 w-5 rounded border-gray-300 text-primary-600 focus:ring-primary-500\"/><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">I understand and accept these conditions</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-xs font-bold text-white\">4</span>Generate Configuration</span></label><div class=\"mt-3\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><div></div></div><button disabled=\"\" class=\"inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-primary-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 sm:w-auto\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z\"></path></svg>Generate Configuration</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center  my-4\" style=\"min-height:250px\"><div data-pw-desk=\"leaderboard_btf\" id=\"pwDeskLbBtf1\"></div><div data-pw-mobi=\"med_rect_btf\" id=\"pwMobiMedRectBtf1\"></div></div><section class=\"mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-gray-700\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this WireGuard VPN really free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The servers, config files and QR codes are free, with no account or signup. VPNBook is funded by ads and donations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I download a WireGuard config file?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Choose a server and a port above, accept the conditions, complete the check and select Generate. You can then download the .conf file, copy the configuration or scan the QR code.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does a config last?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"7 days. After that it stops working, and you can generate a new one at any time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use one config on several devices?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Each config works on one device at a time, so generate a separate one for each phone or computer.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it work on a router?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, on routers that support WireGuard, such as OpenWrt, GL.iNet and MikroTik. Import the .conf file in the router's WireGuard settings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which port should I choose?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start with 443. If it doesn't connect, try 123, then 80. Use 25018 for the best speed on networks that don't block ports.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is WireGuard secure?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"WireGuard uses modern, well-reviewed cryptography and has been part of the Linux kernel since 2020. Your traffic is encrypted between your device and our server. From there it travels to websites as normal, so keep using HTTPS sites for anything sensitive.\"}}]}</script><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">What is a WireGuard VPN?</h2><p class=\"mt-4\">WireGuard is a modern VPN protocol. It has been part of the Linux kernel since 2020 and has official apps for Windows, macOS, iOS and Android. Its code is small enough to audit, a few thousand lines against hundreds of thousands for OpenVPN and its TLS library, and it uses one fixed set of modern ciphers instead of negotiating them.</p><p class=\"mt-3\">A WireGuard VPN connects your device to a WireGuard server using a small configuration file that holds your private key, the server&#x27;s public key and its address. VPNBook runs free WireGuard servers and generates that file for you, so all you need is the official WireGuard app.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">WireGuard vs OpenVPN</h2><div class=\"mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-gray-200\"><table class=\"min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 text-sm\"><thead class=\"bg-gray-50 text-left text-gray-900\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">WireGuard</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">OpenVPN</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100 bg-white\"><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-gray-900\">Speed</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Usually faster, with lower latency</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Slower, especially on phones</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-gray-900\">Encryption</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">ChaCha20-Poly1305, Curve25519 and BLAKE2s, always</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Negotiated over TLS, usually AES-256-GCM</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-gray-900\">Transport</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">UDP only</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">UDP or TCP</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-gray-900\">Switching networks</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Keeps working when you move between Wi-Fi and mobile data</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Usually drops and reconnects</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium text-gray-900\">Setup</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Import one .conf file or scan a QR code</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Import a .ovpn file and enter a username and password</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm\">If a network blocks UDP completely, WireGuard can&#x27;t connect. Use OpenVPN over TCP 443 instead.<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-primary-700 underline hover:text-primary-800\" href=\"/freevpn/openvpn\">Get a free OpenVPN config</a></p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Free WireGuard servers and ports</h2><p class=\"mt-4\">Every server accepts WireGuard on the same four UDP ports. You choose the port when you generate your config.</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Server locations</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><img alt=\"US flag\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"inline-block \" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/us.svg\"/><div><p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">United States</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">us16.vpnbook.com, us178.vpnbook.com</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><img alt=\"CA flag\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"inline-block \" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/ca.svg\"/><div><p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">Canada</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">ca149.vpnbook.com, ca196.vpnbook.com</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><img alt=\"GB flag\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"inline-block \" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/gb.svg\"/><div><p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">United Kingdom</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">uk205.vpnbook.com, uk68.vpnbook.com</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><img alt=\"DE flag\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"inline-block \" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/de.svg\"/><div><p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">Germany</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">de20.vpnbook.com, de220.vpnbook.com</p></div></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><img alt=\"FR flag\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"inline-block \" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://flagcdn.com/fr.svg\"/><div><p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">France</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">fr200.vpnbook.com, fr231.vpnbook.com</p></div></li></ul><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Which port to choose</h3><dl class=\"mt-3 space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">443 (HTTPS)</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">The port HTTPS and HTTP/3 use, so most networks allow it. Try this one first.</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">80 (HTTP)</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">The plain web port. Use it if 443 doesn&#x27;t connect.</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">123 (NTP)</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">The time-sync (NTP) port, often left open on school, office and hotel networks.</dd></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3\"><dt class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">25018</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">An uncommon high port with the least interference. Fastest when nothing is blocked.</dd></div></dl></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">How to connect in three steps</h2><ol class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">1</span><span>Install the official WireGuard app from wireguard.com/install or your device&#x27;s app store.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">2</span><span>Generate a config above: choose a server and a port, accept the conditions and complete the check.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-sm font-semibold text-white\">3</span><span>On a computer, download the .conf file and import it into the app. On a phone, tap + in the app and scan the QR code. Then switch the tunnel on.</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-semibold text-gray-900\">Step-by-step guides</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-primary-700 underline hover:text-primary-800\" href=\"/howto/setup-wireguard-on-windows\">How to set up WireGuard on Windows</a></li><li><a class=\"text-primary-700 underline hover:text-primary-800\" href=\"/howto/setup-wireguard-on-mac-os\">How to set up WireGuard on macOS</a></li><li><a class=\"text-primary-700 underline hover:text-primary-800\" href=\"/howto/setup-wireguard-on-ubuntu\">How to set up WireGuard on Ubuntu</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Why configs expire after 7 days</h2><p class=\"mt-4\">Each config is unique to you, works on one device at a time and lasts 7 days. Expiring keys stops shared or leaked configs from overloading the free servers. When yours expires, come back and generate a new one. It takes a few seconds and needs no account.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Troubleshooting</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">The tunnel is on but never completes a handshake</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">The network is probably blocking that UDP port. Generate a new config on port 443 or 123.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Connected, but websites don&#x27;t load</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Make sure the config was imported unchanged, including its DNS and AllowedIPs lines. Switch the tunnel off and on again, or try another server.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">It worked before and has stopped</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Your config has probably passed its 7 days. Generate a new one.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">The QR code won&#x27;t scan</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Download the .conf file instead and import it from your phone&#x27;s files, or zoom in so the code fills more of the screen.</p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">WireGuard VPN FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Is this WireGuard VPN really free?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Yes. The servers, config files and QR codes are free, with no account or signup. VPNBook is funded by ads and donations.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">How do I download a WireGuard config file?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Choose a server and a port above, accept the conditions, complete the check and select Generate. You can then download the .conf file, copy the configuration or scan the QR code.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">How long does a config last?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">7 days. After that it stops working, and you can generate a new one at any time.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Can I use one config on several devices?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">No. Each config works on one device at a time, so generate a separate one for each phone or computer.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Does it work on a router?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Yes, on routers that support WireGuard, such as OpenWrt, GL.iNet and MikroTik. Import the .conf file in the router&#x27;s WireGuard settings.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Which port should I choose?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">Start with 443. If it doesn&#x27;t connect, try 123, then 80. Use 25018 for the best speed on networks that don&#x27;t block ports.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">Is WireGuard secure?</h3><p class=\"mt-2\">WireGuard uses modern, well-reviewed cryptography and has been part of the Linux kernel since 2020. Your traffic is encrypted between your device and our server. From there it travels to websites as normal, so keep using HTTPS sites for anything sensitive.</p></div></div></div></section><div class=\"mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Support VPNBook</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">This service is Advertisement and Donation based, if you enjoy this service, please consider donating so we can keep this as a free service and add more servers in the future.</p><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-700\">BTC</span><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">Bitcoin</span></div><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200\" title=\"Copy\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15.666 3.888A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 2.25h-3c-1.03 0-1.9.693-2.166 1.638m7.332 0c.055.194.084.4.084.612v0a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H9a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v0c0-.212.03-.418.084-.612m7.332 0c.646.049 1.288.11 1.927.184 1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185V19.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 014.5 19.5V6.257c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.208 48.208 0 011.927-.184\"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><code class=\"mt-2 block break-all font-mono text-xs text-gray-600\">bc1qdravvzf8mypqqtj4dk45zsgczl8jnswrvd7zpz</code></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-700\">ETH</span><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">Ethereum</span></div><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200\" title